"events ordered in arrival order or (2) a set of unique field values "
"ordered lexicographically. If a \\\n"
"comma/space delimited list of fields is provided only those fields are "
"rendered as lists"
msgstr ""
"트랜잭션의 다중값 필드가 (1) 도착 순서대로 정렬된 원래 이벤트 리스트인지 아니면 \\\n"
